      "desc:8": "§6Machine type: §aDisassembler§r\n\nThe incomplete becomes complete; the crooked becomes straight; the empty becomes full; the worn out becomes new.\nHow your other machine assembles the item, this one disassembles it back.\nNote: The component assembly line casing level limit recipe the machine can perform.\nNo energy consumption.\n\n[note]Hatches[/note]: Input Bus, Output Bus, Output Hatch\n[note]Structure[/note]: Tiered glass (limits the energy hatch tier); Cosmic Neutronium Frame Boxes; Component Assembly Line Casings (tier limits recipes); the casings in the optional task.\nUse a Hologram Projector (or the NEI structure preview) to see and auto-build the structure.\n\n[note]Controller recipe[/note]: Assembly Line, UEV\nResearch item: Machine LV Assembler\n - 64x Assembling Machine UHV\n - 16x Field Generator UHV\n - 64x Electric Pump UHV\n - 64x Conveyor Module UHV\n - 256x Robot Arm UHV\n - 64x EM Power\n - 16x Cosmic Neutronium Frame Box\n - 16x Osmiridium Dense Plate\n - 147,456 L Solder plasma\n - 128,000 L UU Matter\n - 768,000x Super Coolant",
